dcasts":{},"blocks":{},"comments":{"%/qI,wgw|{*=Dc+[hNi%":{"blockId":null,"x":105.18518518518519,"y":63.29629629629629,"width":622.3703002929688,"height":522.4073791503906,"minimized":false,"text":"Goal 1: Make the yellow cat sing when it gets a broadcast called\n\"Yellow Cat's Cue\"\n\n1. Get the \"When I Receive\" block from the Events section\n2. Click the arrow in the block and change it to \"YELLOW Cat's Cue\"\n3. Attach the \"Play sound 'singer2' until done\" block from the Sound section\n4. Now, add a broadcast block from the Events section \n5. Rename the message1 broadcast to \"Harmonize\" by clicking the little arrow to next to \"message1\"\n\n\nGoal 2: Then, make all the cats sing at the same time using another broadcast named \"Harmonize\". This will be a separate script.\n\n6. Take out a \"When I receive\" block form the Events section\n7. Set it to: \"Harmonize\"\n8. Attach the \"Play sound 'singer2' until done\" block from the Sound section\n9. Repeat steps 6, 7 and 8 in Red cat and Orange cat sprites.\n\nNow when you click the flag, red cat sings, then orange cat, then yellow cat, and then they all sing in harmony\n"}},"currentCostume":0,"costumes":[{"name":"costume1","bitmapResolution":1,"dataFormat":"svg","assetId":"874278f993a4738417301f2d4c89cae6","md5ext":"874278f993a4738417301f2d4c89cae6.svg","rotationCenterX":47.678985050489445,"rotationCenterY":49.499230353205405},{"name":"costume2","bitmapResolution":1,"dataFormat":"svg","assetId":"e6ddc55a6ddd9cc9d84fe0b4c21e016f","md5ext":"e6ddc55a6ddd9cc9d84fe0b4c21e016f.svg","rotationCenterX":46,"rotationCenterY":53}],"sounds":[{"name":"Singer2","assetId":"b8735c3c87ca2f41fc9c193e83b0bb76","dataFormat":"wav","format":"","rate":44100,"sampleCount":45455,"md5ext":"b8735c3c87ca2f41fc9c193e83b0bb76.wav"}],"volume":100,"layerOrder":5,"visible":true,"x":113.81241180312949,"y":-40.0642340648328,"size":100,"direction":90,"draggable":false,"rotationStyle":"all around"},{"isStage":false,"name":"Ms. Girl","variables":{},"lists":{},"broadcasts":{},"blocks":{},"comments":{"kGY*[UuY21=xKtF{TxCg":{"blockId":null,"x":188,"y":417,"width":775.9259033203125,"height":378.8148193359375,"minimized":false,"text":"Goal: Make \"Ms. Girl\" Applaud After Harmonizing Stops\n\n1. Go to the Events section and drag out a \"When I receive [message1]\" block. Click the arrow in the block and set it to \"Harmonize.\"\n\n2. Go to the Control section and attach a \"wait [1] seconds\" block below the \"When I receive [Harmonize]\" block.\n\n3. Go to the Sound section and attach the \"play sound Clapping until done\" block after the \"wait\" block.\n\nNow, when \"Ms. Girl\" receives the \"Harmonize\" broadcast, she will wait one second and then play the \"Clapping\" sound!"}},"currentCostume":3,"costumes":[{"name":"character2-a","bitmapResolution":1,"dataFormat":"svg","assetId":"7084b3baab935de819cc5ab46f7cecf8","md5ext":"7084b3baab935de819cc5ab46f7cecf8.svg","rotationCenterX":47.99056799868501,"rotationCenterY":127.80503283089969},{"name":"character2-b","bitmapResolution":1,"dataFormat":"svg","assetId":"df7cbf2913bcea721df2e0360644f193","md5ext":"df7cbf2913bcea721df2e0360644f193.svg","rotationCenterX":44.99552075655663,"rotationCenterY":125.14875889583388},{"name":"character2-c","bitmapResolution":1,"dataFormat":"svg","assetId":"e0eacf1e575adc559c41e3a81a892168","md5ext":"e0eacf1e575adc559c41e3a81a892168.svg","rotationCenterX":47.95809,"rotationCenterY":123.53880000000001},{"name":"character2-d","bitmapResolution":1,"dataFormat":"svg","assetId":"e8b44b0e904fd4bb7430c26b743f1520","md5ext":"e8b44b0e904fd4bb7430c26b743f1520.svg","rotationCenterX":44.995540756556636,"rotationCenterY":128.2061488659535},{"name":"character2-e","bitmapResolution":1,"dataFormat":"svg","assetId":"67d425b11544caa0fe9228f355c6485b","md5ext":"67d425b11544caa0fe9228f355c6485b.svg","rotationCenterX":48.00809000000001,"rotationCenterY":122.45},{"name":"character2-f","bitmapResolution":1,"dataFormat":"svg","assetId":"db3f436fcb6fb288