 Loop:\n        Go to the Control section and add a \"forever\" block under the green flag block.\n3. Add an \"If\" Block:\n        Inside the \"forever\" block, drag an \"if <> then\" block from the Control section.\n4. Add the \"AND\" Operator:\n        Go to the Operators section and find the \"and\" block. Put it in the diamond-shaped space in the \"if\" block.\n5. In the first space of the \"and\" block, add a \"mouse down?\" block from the Sensing section.\n        In the second space, add a \"touching [mouse-pointer]?\" block from the Sensing section (make sure it says \"mouse-pointer\").\n6. Play the Applause Sound:\n        Go to the Sound section and add a \"start sound [Clapping]\" block inside the \"if\" block.\n\nNow, when you click the \"Some Guy\" sprite and the mouse is over it, you should hear the applause sound!"}},"currentCostume":7,"costumes":[{"name":"character1-a","bitmapResolution":1,"dataFormat":"svg","assetId":"03bc23a9fa12c1244c83a07a81f20bfd","md5ext":"03bc23a9fa12c1244c83a07a81f20bfd.svg","rotationCenterX":49.8898709690844,"rotationCenterY":124.76092657062226},{"name":"character1-b","bitmapResolution":1,"dataFormat":"svg","assetId":"f26b130c2c58b812be21d1a9745863a1","md5ext":"f26b130c2c58b812be21d1a9745863a1.svg","rotationCenterX":54.60290188300769,"rotationCenterY":122.98040317401274},{"name":"character1-c","bitmapResolution":1,"dataFormat":"svg","assetId":"cc0be722cf93eef63726bd606ab11c5c","md5ext":"cc0be722cf93eef63726bd606ab11c5c.svg","rotationCenterX":54.60291410943074,"rotationCenterY":126.85057804587933},{"name":"character1-d","bitmapResolution":1,"dataFormat":"svg","assetId":"6be261800647c53becb1f93ed31ed13e","md5ext":"6be261800647c53becb1f93ed31ed13e.svg","rotationCenterX":54.602918664146046,"rotationCenterY":123.84994499999999},{"name":"character1-e","bitmapResolution":1,"dataFormat":"svg","assetId":"6f78ce6a87d114162ed9fbef30f9a0fd","md5ext":"6f78ce6a87d114162ed9fbef30f9a0fd.svg","rotationCenterX":65.725,"rotationCenterY":120.6